#. え………………？
msgctxt "0001 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Huh...?"
msgstr ""

#. さくら…ちゃん…が…
msgctxt "0002 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Sakura's..."
msgstr ""

#. さくらちゃん…が……
msgctxt "0003 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Sakura's..."
msgstr ""

#. 死ん…だ…？
msgctxt "0004 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "...dead?"
msgstr ""

#. 死んじゃったの……？
msgctxt "0005 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "She's...really dead?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>背中に朝日奈さんの声を聞きながら、
#. ボクの視線は、ただ１点のみに注がれていた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I heard Hina talking, but my eyes stared steadily\n"
"forward.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>目の前の…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I could only look on...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4><CLT><CLT 3>大神さんの死体<CLT><CLT 4>に…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...at <CLT><CLT 3>Sakura's dead body<CLT><CLT 4>.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 間に合わなかったわね…
msgctxt "0009 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "We didn't make it in time."
msgstr ""

#. また…起きてしまったわ…
msgctxt "0010 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "It's happened again..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>噛みしめるように呟きながら、
#. 霧切さんは大神さんの死体にそっと手を触れた…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Muttering to herself, Kyoko began to gently inspect\n"
"Sakura's body.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>死亡確認…のようなものだろうか？
#. 脈や反応を確かめているようだった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I wondered, was she confirming that Sakura really was\n"
"dead? Checking for a pulse, or a reaction?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0013 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. 呼んで…こなくちゃ……
msgctxt "0014 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I have to go get them..."
msgstr ""

#. みんなを…呼んでこなくちゃ……
msgctxt "0015 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I have to go get...the others..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>朝日奈さんはふらふらとした足取りで、
#. 娯楽室を後にした…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>On shaky legs, Hina left the rec room.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そして…ボクは……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And I...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. どう…して……？
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Why...?"
msgstr ""

#. どうして…こんな事に……？
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Why...did this have to happen?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そう呟く事しか出来なかった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That's all I could say.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ただ…同じ言葉を呟く事しか……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I repeated it over and over again...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 大神さんの体を…調べないとね……
msgctxt "0022 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I need to examine Sakura's body..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>死体の脈や反応を確かめている霧切さんの後ろで、
#. ボクは、ただ立ち尽くしていた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I just stood there motionless behind her, while she\n"
"checked Sakura's corpse.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>時間だけが過ぎていった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Time passed.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>何も出来ないまま、ただ時間だけ過ぎていった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>While I stood there, unable to do a thing, time\n"
"just...passed.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そして…しばらくしたところで…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And after I don't know how long...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 連れて…来たよ……
msgctxt "0027 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I got everyone..."
msgstr ""

#. おわッ！！　オ、オーガ！？
msgctxt "0028 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Uwah! O-Ogre!?"
msgstr ""

#. あらぁ…こりゃ死んじゃってますね。
msgctxt "0029 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Oh. So she's dead, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. そうか…大神さくらが殺されたのか…
msgctxt "0030 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Sakura's been killed? I see..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>残りの３人がやって来たところで、
#. 霧切さんが切り出した。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>As soon as they arrived, Kyoko began...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. さっきの死体発見アナウンスは聞いたわね？
#. それなら、これがどういう事かわかるでしょ？
msgctxt "0032 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"You heard the announcement just now, right? So you\n"
"know what this means."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>大神さくらは殺された<CLT>…
#. ここにいる誰かに殺された…
msgctxt "0033 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 3>Sakura was murdered<CLT>. And by someone in this very\n"
"room..."
msgstr ""

#. …そういう事だろう？
msgctxt "0034 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Is that what you were going to say?"
msgstr ""

#. …ちが…う。
msgctxt "0035 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "...No."
msgstr "...Không."

#. ここにいる誰か…なんかじゃない…
msgctxt "0036 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Whoever killed her..."
msgstr ""

#. さくらちゃんを…殺したのは…
msgctxt "0037 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "...it's not just \"someone in this room.\""
msgstr ""

#. 葉隠、十神、腐川…の誰かだよッ！
msgctxt "0038 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"It was one of you... Hiro, Byakuya, Toko—one of you\n"
"killed Sakura!"
msgstr ""

#. なな…ッ！？
msgctxt "0039 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Wh-Wh—!?"
msgstr ""

#. 捜査もしてないのに断言か…？
msgctxt "0040 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"You're accusing us before we've even begun the\n"
"investigation?"
msgstr ""

#. 捜査なんかしなくたって…わかるよ…
msgctxt "0041 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I don't need to investigate anything..."
msgstr ""

#. だって、あんた達は…
#. さくらちゃんを目の敵にしてたじゃん…
msgctxt "0042 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Because you hated her. You hated the sight of her!"
msgstr ""

#. 犯人は、あんた達の誰かに決まってるよ！！
msgctxt "0043 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "One of you did it, I know it!"
msgstr ""

#. 犯人が…決まってる…？
msgctxt "0044 | NO NAME"
msgid "You...know it?"
msgstr ""

#. まさか…貴様は怒りによって、
#. 推理力を何倍にも高めるタイプの地球人かッ！！
msgctxt "0045 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Jeez, I didn't know your power level would increase by\n"
"that much just by getting mad!"
msgstr ""

#. 何しに…来たの…？
msgctxt "0046 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "What are you doing here...?"
msgstr ""

#. 決まってんじゃん。配りに来たんですよ。
#. 殺人フリーペーパーこと…
msgctxt "0047 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Isn't it obvious? I'm here to hand out my little\n"
"murder flyer."
msgstr ""

#. “ザ・モノクマファイル４”を！
msgctxt "0048 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "That's right! It's the next Monokuma File!"
msgstr ""

#. …朝日奈さん、そんなに怒ってたら、
#. いやらしいお顔が台無しですぞッ！！
msgctxt "0049 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"And don't get so mad, Miss Asahina, or you're gonna\n"
"ruin that lewd little face of yours!"
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、ボクはこの辺で…
msgctxt "0050 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Now then! With that, I—"
msgstr ""

#. …ちょっと待てよ。
msgctxt "0051 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Hold on..."
msgstr ""

#. お前に…聞いておきたい事があるんだ…
msgctxt "0052 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "There's something I want to ask you..."
msgstr ""

#. …はい？
msgctxt "0053 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

#. 大神さんを殺したのは…お前なんじゃないのか？
msgctxt "0054 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "It was you, wasn't it? You killed Sakura?"
msgstr ""

#. …はいはい？
msgctxt "0055 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Huh huh?"
msgstr ""

#. 大神さんは、黒幕に戦いを挑むって言ってた…
msgctxt "0056 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Sakura wanted to challenge the mastermind to a duel."
msgstr ""

#. もしかしたら、お前と大神さんはまた戦って…
#. そこで彼女を…
msgctxt "0057 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Maybe you and her fought again, and then..."
msgstr ""

#. …殺したと？
msgctxt "0058 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Then I killed her?"
msgstr ""

#. うーん、当たらずも近からず…
msgctxt "0059 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Sorry, not quite! Actually, not even close."
msgstr ""

#. つまり的外れッ！！
msgctxt "0060 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "That whole thing is totally irrelevant now!"
msgstr ""

#. 大神さんは、ボクとの戦いにたどり着く事なく、
#. 無念の死を遂げたのですよ！
msgctxt "0061 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Sakura came to a most regrettable end without even\n"
"getting the chance to finish things with me..."
msgstr ""

#. でも、お陰で助かっちゃったよ！
#. 彼女のケンカを買う必要もなくなったしさ！
msgctxt "0062 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Which, thank God for that! It saved me the trouble of\n"
"having to go through with our little fight."
msgstr ""

#. だってね、さすがのボクでも、
#. あの化物を倒すのはそんなに簡単じゃない訳ですよ…
msgctxt "0063 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Cuz even for someone like me, it would've been no mean\n"
"feat to take down a behemoth like that!"
msgstr ""

#. だから、困ってたの！
msgctxt "0064 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "I gotta tell ya, I was actually pretty worried!"
msgstr ""

#. ボクへの暴力は禁止という校則違反を犯しつつ、
#. ヤツには罰を与えられなかったからさ…
msgctxt "0065 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"I mean, she'd violated a rule by attacking me in the\n"
"first place, but I wasn't able to punish her!"
msgstr ""

#. …だから、どこの誰だか知らないけど、
#. 今回のクロには感謝してるんだよねー！！
msgctxt "0066 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"So I dunno who it was, but whoever the blackened is\n"
"this time...I owe ya one!"
msgstr ""

#. か、感謝！？
msgctxt "0067 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Y-You owe them one!?"
msgstr ""

#. おっとっと！　ボクに怒りをぶつける前に、
#. まずは犯人を捜さないと！
msgctxt "0068 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Oopsie! Before you get all pissy-potty at me, you\n"
"better figure out who did it first!"
msgstr ""

#. だって…オマエラの命がかかってるんだよ？
msgctxt "0069 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Cuz I mean...your lives are all on the line, right?"
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷぷ…
msgctxt "0070 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Puhuhu..."
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷぷぷ～！
msgctxt "0071 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Puhuhuhuhu!"
msgstr ""

#. なに…それ……
#. 感謝…なんて……
msgctxt "0072 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "What the hell...? He owes them one?"
msgstr ""

#. そんなの酷いッ！　酷過ぎるよッ！
msgctxt "0073 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I hate him! I hate this whole thing!"
msgstr ""

#. だが、犠牲者が大神で良かったのは確かだ。
#. あいつは黒幕の内通者だったんだからな…
msgctxt "0074 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Well I, for one, am glad it was Sakura. She was\n"
"working for the mastermind, after all."
msgstr ""

#. そ、そんな言い方って…ッ！
msgctxt "0075 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "H-How can you say that now...!?"
msgstr ""

#. おっと…お前らなんかと口論している時間はない。
#. もうゲームは始まっているんだ…
msgctxt "0076 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Sorry, I don't have time for your squabbling. The next\n"
"game has already begun..."
msgstr ""

#. 恨むなら、大神を殺した犯人を恨むんだな。
msgctxt "0077 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"If you want to be angry at someone, be angry at\n"
"whoever killed Sakura."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0078 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. …今は犯人を見つける事を、
#. 第一に考えましょう。
msgctxt "0079 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Right now, our top priority needs to be uncovering\n"
"Sakura's killer."
msgstr ""

#. 犯人を見つけなければ、
#. 私達全員が処刑されてしまうんだし…
msgctxt "0080 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "If we can't do that, we're all dead."
msgstr ""

#. では、まずは現場の見張り役から決めるか。
msgctxt "0081 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Then let's decide who will stand guard this time."
msgstr ""

#. 私が…やるよ……
msgctxt "0082 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "...I'll do it."
msgstr ""

#. 朝日奈さん…？
msgctxt "0083 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Hina...?"
msgstr ""

#. 私なら大丈夫……
msgctxt "0084 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I'm okay..."
msgstr ""

#. だから私に任せて…！
msgctxt "0085 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Just let me handle it...!"
msgstr ""

#. それに…私はここに残っていたい…
#. さくらちゃんと一緒に…
msgctxt "0086 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Besides, I...I want to be here...with Sakura."
msgstr ""

#. では、１人目は朝日奈で決まりだ。
#. もう１人は…
msgctxt "0087 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Okay, then Hina is guard number one. But we need one\n"
"more."
msgstr ""

#. …お前だ、霧切。
msgctxt "0088 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Kyoko, that's you."
msgstr ""

#. …私が？
msgctxt "0089 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "...Me?"
msgstr ""

#. お前はいつも目ざわりだ。
#. 今回は大人しく見張りをしていろ。これは命令だ。
msgctxt "0090 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"You're always a thorn in my side. This time just stand\n"
"by and watch quietly. Consider that an order."
msgstr ""

#. め、命令って…！
msgctxt "0091 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "An o-order!?"
msgstr ""

#. …いいわ。じゃあ私が残りましょう。
msgctxt "0092 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Fine. I'll stay behind."
msgstr ""

#. これで決定だな。
#. では、さっそく始めるとしよう。
msgctxt "0093 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Then it's settled. Let's begin, shall we?"
msgstr ""

#. …ちょっと待って！
msgctxt "0094 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "...Hold on!"
msgstr ""

#. その前に…言っておく事がある…
msgctxt "0095 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Before that, there's something I want to say."
msgstr ""

#. …なんだ？
msgctxt "0096 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Which is...?"
msgstr ""

#. 葉隠、十神、腐川の３人は、
#. 現場に入っちゃ駄目だから…
msgctxt "0097 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Hiro, Byakuya, Toko—none of you are allowed to step\n"
"foot in the crime scene."
msgstr ""

#. へ…？
msgctxt "0098 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "What...?"
msgstr ""

#. さくらちゃんを殺したのは、
#. あんた達じゃん！！
msgctxt "0099 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "One of you killed Sakura!"
msgstr ""

#. そんなヤツらに、
#. さくらちゃんを触らせられないよ！
msgctxt "0100 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I won't let someone like that come anywhere near her!"
msgstr ""

#. ふざけるな。こっちだって命がかかっているんだ。
#. 捜査するのは当然の権利のはずだ。
msgctxt "0101 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Don't be stupid. Our lives are in just as much danger\n"
"as yours! We have every right to investigate."
msgstr ""

#. なんて言おうと…犯人にさくらちゃんは触らせない…
msgctxt "0102 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"I don't care what you say. I'm not letting the one who\n"
"killed Sakura anywhere near her."
msgstr ""

#. 力ずくでも絶対に入れないからッ！！
msgctxt "0103 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Even if it means I have to use force, you're not\n"
"getting in here...!"
msgstr ""

#. どうやら、このまま言い合いをしてても、
#. 時間の無駄のようだ…
msgctxt "0104 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Well, it appears further discussion would be a waste\n"
"of time."
msgstr ""

#. …だったら、譲歩案を出してやろう。
msgctxt "0105 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "How about a compromise?"
msgstr ""

#. ３人全員とは言わん。俺だけを許可しろ。
msgctxt "0106 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "I won't ask you to let all of us in. Just let me."
msgstr ""

#. えーーッ！？
msgctxt "0107 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr ""

#. …構わないだろう。
#. どっちにしろ、お前らは役立たずなんだ。
msgctxt "0108 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"You don't really care, do you? You're both useless,\n"
"anyway."
msgstr ""

#. アタシは別にいーっすよ！
msgctxt "0109 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Nope, don't really caaaare!"
msgstr ""

#. 捜査より、白夜様とのファンタスティックな妄想を
#. 繰り広げてる方が、ずっと有意義だしね！！
msgctxt "0110 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"I'd rather spend my time coming up with another\n"
"splendid fantasy involving Master, anyway!"
msgstr ""

#. …葉隠も文句はないな？
msgctxt "0111 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "And you, Hiro? Do you really object?"
msgstr ""

#. そ、そこまで言うなら…仕方ないべ…
#. どっちにしろ…別にやましい事もねーし…
msgctxt "0112 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"I-If you're gonna go that far, what can I do? I mean,\n"
"I don't have anything to hide, so why should I care?"
msgstr ""

#. …では決まりだ。
msgctxt "0113 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Then it's decided."
msgstr ""

#. 勝手に決めないでよ！
msgctxt "0114 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Nothing's decided!"
msgstr ""

#. …朝日奈さん、あなたの気持ちもわかるけど、
#. ここは十神君の案で納得して…
msgctxt "0115 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I know how you feel, Hina, but you should agree to his\n"
"request."
msgstr ""

#. で、でも…！
msgctxt "0116 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "B-But—!"
msgstr ""

#. 私達は、大神さんを殺した犯人を
#. 突きとめなければならないわ…
msgctxt "0117 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "We have to find out who killed Sakura."
msgstr ""

#. 生き残った私達の為にも…
#. そして、死んだ大神さんの為にもね…
msgctxt "0118 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"For those of us still alive, and to honor Sakura's\n"
"memory..."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0119 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. …わかったよ。
#. じゃあ、それでいいけど…
msgctxt "0120 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Fine. I guess that's okay."
msgstr ""

#. だけど…十神は絶対に、
#. さくらちゃんに触っちゃ駄目だから…
msgctxt "0121 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"But no matter what, Byakuya, you absolutely aren't\n"
"allowed to touch her...!"
msgstr ""

#. 当たり前だ。
#. 誰が薄汚い死体なんかに触るか。
msgctxt "0122 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Naturally. Who would want to touch a filthy dead body?"
msgstr ""

#. …ケンカはそこまでよ。
#. ここから先は捜査に集中しましょう。
msgctxt "0123 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"That's enough fighting. We need to focus on the\n"
"investigation from here on out."
msgstr ""

#. みんな、よく覚えておいてね。
#. 誰が大神さんを殺したのか解き明かさない限り…
msgctxt "0124 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Everyone, keep this in mind. If we can't uncover\n"
"Sakura's killer..."
msgstr ""

#. 生き残った私達も…全員殺されてしまうのよ…
msgctxt "0125 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "...all of us face execution."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>大神さんを殺した犯人を暴く…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0126 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Finding out who killed Sakura...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>望む望まないの問題じゃない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0127 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's not a matter of hoping we can do it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それだけが、ボクらが生き残る唯一の方法なんだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0128 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>If we want to survive, we *have* to do it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>絶望的な希望……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0129 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's a kind of...hopeless hope.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>やるしか…ないんだ…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0130 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>We have no choice but to just do it...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
